This project builds on the following. The published container images include them, with their notices;
models are downloaded separately under their own terms.

- Open WebUI (https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui), Open WebUI License (BSD-3-Clause with a
  branding clause). webui/Dockerfile builds on its published image and webui/patches/ edit its built
  files; its branding is left in place.
- llama.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp), MIT. compose.yml runs its published Vulkan
  server image unmodified.
- Qwen3.8-27B (https://huggingface.co/Qwen), Apache-2.0, in the GGUF conversion by Unsloth
  (https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF), downloaded by install.sh.
- npu-cosyvoice (https://github.com/YuhuaBillChen/npu-cosyvoice), Apache-2.0, which in turn uses
  CosyVoice3 (Apache-2.0) and whisper-xdna (MIT); see its NOTICE.

- Open Intelligent UI (https://github.com/thesysdev/open-intelligent-ui), MIT, copyright 2026
  Thesys Inc.; component library pinned to 03213439358bf3408ad61a46ec9e3230c5572e48.
  Built at image creation with its pinned npm dependencies. MIT license, dependency notices,
  and source provenance are served under /static/buddy-openui/. Buddy's host adapter is original
  code; it does not include the separate thesysdev/openwebui-plugin.
